#: ../../../gpu/amdgpu/driver-core:240:
#: ../drivers/gpu/drm/amd/include/amd_shared.h:57
msgid ""
"GPUs are composed of IP (intellectual property) blocks. These IP blocks "
"provide various functionalities: display, graphics, video decode, etc. The "
"IP blocks that comprise a particular GPU are listed in the GPU's respective "
"SoC file. amdgpu_device.c acquires the list of IP blocks for the GPU in use "
"on initialization. It can then operate on this list to perform standard "
"driver operations such as: init, fini, suspend, resume, etc."
